# Weakens B's BulkHintBound in this module's environment: the bulk-born leaf is born
# at a position at or below its hint, but need not hold every record at or below it,
# so its read position lies above a record it does not hold at birth. Shows the
# assumption, in exactly the form B guarantees, is load-bearing.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeBulkHintAboveUnheld
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the bulk-born leaf is born above a record it does not hold
PERTURBS: Create
BOUNDS: WithBulk = TRUE

--- FIND
        /\ \A o \in Allocated : o <= r => o \in held
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the leaf need not hold the records at or below its birth position.
        /\ TRUE
--- END
